      "responseContract": "appcall-provider-json-v1",
      "adaptations": [
        "Healthcheck maps to the pinned validator GET /accounts/{accountId}/r2/buckets?per_page=1, a cheap authenticated bucket list rather than a billed object fetch or SigV4 S3 call.",
        "accountId is a required path segment. Native sends Authorization Bearer only. OAuth (dash.cloudflare.com/oauth2) is omitted.",
        "HTTP 200 envelopes with a populated errors array are demoted via bodyErrorPaths [errors]. success is not used because true would false-fail.",
        "Native category is dev-tools (source Storage/Developer Tools). Returns raw Cloudflare JSON under data. Upstream user-agent is not sent."
      ]
    },
    "buckets.list": {
      "upstreamActionId": "list_buckets",
      "sourceRefs": [
        "action-list-buckets",
        "handler-list-buckets",
        "request-envelope"
      ],
      "documentationUrls": [
        "https://developers.cloudflare.com/api/resources/r2/subresources/buckets/methods/list/"
      ],
      "responseContract": "appcall-provider-json-v1",
      "adaptations": [
        "accountId is a required path segment. Optional cursor, direction, nameContains, order, and perPage bind to documented query names cursor, direction, name_contains, order, per_page.",
        "Returns raw Cloudflare JSON under data rather than the pinned {buckets, cursor} reshape."
      ]
    },
    "buckets.get": {
      "upstreamActionId": "get_bucket",
      "sourceRefs": [
        "action-get-bucket",
        "handler-get-bucket",
        "request-envelope"
      ],
      "documentationUrls": [
        "https://developers.cloudflare.com/api/resources/r2/subresources/buckets/methods/get/"
      ],
      "responseContract": "appcall-provider-json-v1",
      "adaptations": [
        "accountId and bucketName are URL-encoded path segments on GET /accounts/{accountId}/r2/buckets/{bucketName}. Official 3-64 character bucket names are not expressed as maxLength; strict-generated schemas reject that keyword.",
        "Optional cf-r2-jurisdiction header from pinned source is omitted; default jurisdiction applies. Returns raw Cloudflare JSON under data rather than {bucket}."
      ]
    },
    "cors.get": {
